From 7bd5397a87bbd98d8cf76be9325203fc46c54748 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GuaiYiHu <guaiyihu@foxmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 03:07:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: Retain classic-only controllers with current
 Android 17 managers

Adapt the reviewed Android16 BR/EDR-only support to Android17 interfaces. Preserve current sysprop/security-singleton APIs, local-name enable promise, scanner caller/CSIS/discovery handling, event-mask composition and interface release behavior. Do not restore the removed scanner init or removed feature flags.

Read actual controller features before issuing LE-only commands. Bind the completion promise before the HCI event and wait for LE feature discovery only on LE-capable controllers. Guard absent LE advertising/scanning interfaces, including the new discovery entry points, while retaining BR/EDR SSP behavior.

Reviewed against actual current callback templates and API definitions. Full Android17 compilation and actual controller runtime validation remain required; old Android16 device evidence is not Android17 validation.

Change-Id: Ifa1872c180c50536af878324b75019281313c030
